              "content": "Mobile layouts wrap at 320 px. Flexible control heights grow beyond 48 when labels wrap. Desktop tasks reuse a single-column body in a keyboard-accessible panel; at 200% zoom it becomes a full-page task. Scroll content without hiding focused fields behind chrome. Actual resize/reflow awaits a runnable app.",
